[00:01.00] 作曲 : Bastian Langebæk/Max Wolfgang/Olivia Dean
[00:10.86]I, I don't know if you'll call me again
[00:10.86]我不知道 你是否会再联系我
[00:14.45]Chasing rabbits don't usually end with
[00:14.45]追逐幻影 通常不会迎来
[00:19.02]Happy ever after
[00:19.02]幸福美满结局
[00:21.51]And you make reality feel so bizarre
[00:21.51]你让现实变得如此荒诞
[00:25.42]Just because of the person you are
[00:25.42]只因你是这般独特的人
[00:28.17]And I'm asking all the questions, like
[00:28.17]我不断追问自己
[00:33.87]How can you get close to someone
[00:33.87]如何靠近一个
[00:36.65]You keep out of reach?
[00:36.65]你刻意疏远的人？
[00:39.34]And where does that leave me?
[00:39.34]我又该置身何处？
[00:44.79]'Cos you don't make it easy
[00:44.79]因为你从不让我轻松
[00:47.68]Now I'm all close up
[00:47.68]如今我全然封闭
[00:50.18]I can't tell if you need me
[00:50.18]分不清你是否需要我
[00:53.00]Or want me all that much
[00:53.00]是否真心渴望我
[00:55.71]Did I mis-read completely every single touch?
[00:55.71]难道我完全误读了每次触碰？
[01:01.28]Do you even see me?
[01:01.28]你可曾真正看见我？
[01:06.25]Now I'm more than a voice on the phone
[01:06.25]如今我不只是电话里的声音
[01:09.03]Now I'm here and we're finally alone
[01:09.03]此刻我们终于独处
[01:11.92]Why do we feel so distant?
[01:11.92]为何感觉如此遥远？
[01:16.14]You're treating me like I'm one of the rest
[01:16.14]你待我如芸芸众生
[01:19.90]I feel stupid for wearing that dress
